.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "25 September 2026" "libmyutils v1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy up to n characters from source string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <mystrfunctions.h>
.sp
.BI "int mystrncpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ", int " n ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR mystrncpy ()
function copies at most
.I n
bytes from string
.I src
to buffer
.I dest
and null-terminates the result.
